  "readme": "# VEED Lipsync 2.0\n\nVEED Lipsync 2.0 makes the person in a video articulate a new audio track.\n\n## Fields\n\n| Field | Type | Default | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `video` | video URL, required | — | Video with the speaker. |\n| `audio` | audio URL, required | — | Replacement speech. |\n\n## Billing\n\n$0.075 per output second. The quote before submission assumes 5 seconds.\n\n| Output | Price |\n|---|---|\n| 5s | $0.375 |\n| 30s | $2.25 |\n| 60s | $4.50 |\n\nFailed runs are not charged.\n\n## Also on SandBase\n\nRelated: `sync/lipsync/3.0/video-to-video`.\n",
